{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":103177,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"JessieL\" no worries! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Just thought i'd let you know that it may actually be for the better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79285-moon-palace-grand-closed-for-remodeling\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTI4NTsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437746894,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79285},{"Id":103166,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nOh exciting. Not long then. We're actually going back on 22nd September for a reunion holiday we can't wait!\n\nI made my own bouquets as I make them for a living. I used my bridesmaids bouquets as table centres and got deco to provide the vases for me.\n\nI took my dress on as hand luggage as I didn't want to risk it. The shop where I brought it from boxed it up for me.\n\nI will email you some pictures over x\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437735839,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103164,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/264357-ems85\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nThis information would be helpful for me too, my wedding is in Ocrober.\nWe have now been moved to the Venado Terrace as the Caribbean Terrace is closing due to refurbishment works <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\nThe lighting is so expensive, we liked the lanterns and string lights but the need to put up structures plus the lights so will work out over budget for me too.\nAny tips or ideas would be much appreciated.\n \nx\n-----------------------------\n\nJust to let you know they don't need to put up structures for the lanterns as they use the lamp posts which are already there to attach them to. \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437734203,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":103163,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nSorry I forgot to say yes there was a bar and this was included in the basic package x\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437733709,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103162,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nI live just outside of London. I remember worrying about the same things. I just wanted it to be perfect and it was as will yours be. \n\nWith regards to the lanterns they are actually lights so you can provide the lanterns and they will attach these on to the lights for you. They look so effective once the sun starts to set.\nYou can get them on eBay pretty cheap. I actually ordreed mine from the states as I wanted parasols which matched the colours of the bridesmaids dresses. They were really reasonable but the postage charge was the same amount as the actual order.\nI think about 24 lanterns covered the area I wanted. We did have a separate bamboo structure which had about 12 lanterns hanging down which looked really effective to. \n\nWe didn't have a DJ as I knew what songs I wanted to be played so I hired the IPod dock with speakers and lights. With this they had a guy sitting there all night operating it. But as I did a playlist he didn't have to do much. \n\nI didn't upgrade the cake but I provided my own cake topper for it so it looked really nice. We had the cheesecake option And everybody said it was amazing.\n\nThe day after we arrived we had our blood tests and then we had the meeting with our coordinator. We were there 2 weeks before the wedding so we could chill out before the big event. I think we pretty much had everything sorted before the meeting but they go over all the details where you can add and change things.\n\nIf you would like me to send you some photos let me know.\nWhat date is your wedding?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437733660,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103158,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nDon't worry about asking too many questions. Ask away <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\nEverything I brought myself (including lanterns) I gave to my wedding co ordinatior with instructions of what I would like done with them. I wasnt charged any extra for this as there was already a set up and delivery fee of $150.\nThey hung all the lanterns for me. They did a fab job. It made it so much cheaper providing my own lanterns. I also provided my own table runners which they were happy to set up for me. \n\nThe terrace was perfect. I originally wanted the roof top terrace on the grand side. However there were lots of extra charges as it was upstairs and they said anybody could come up and use the bar during the reception which I wasn't so keen on. The terrace ended up being the most perfect place. \nOur wedding was at 3pm which in my view was perfect. Everything ran so smoothly from there. I missed the entire cocktail hour as we were having photos taken during this time.\nWe used the hotel photographer who was fab. We payed around $2000 for our package which included a couple of hours of video. To be honest I wish we had just gone all out and had the entire day filmed as they are moments you can never get back. I've seen outside vendors can do an amazing job but they cost quite a bit more. I'd say if you are happy with their portfolio I'm sure they will do an amazing job and be worth every penny. \n\nIf you need any more advice let me know xx\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437727917,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103152,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nJessieL (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283575-jessiel\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nThanks@\"perianjay\"!\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79285-moon-palace-grand-closed-for-remodeling\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTI4NTsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":283575,"Name":"JessieL","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437719109,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79285},{"Id":102986,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nLeoMax (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284049-leomax\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nCaribbean Terrace is closing due to refurbishment works <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nThat's too bad. I was supposed to attend a wedding there in a few weeks. I guess that I will get a call about venue change soon.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":284049,"Name":"LeoMax","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284049.png?_r=1437433269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437682694,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102972,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nHello\n\nLovely to hear from you. Deco Cancun did our decor for us. This is a break down of what we had.\nHere's the breakdown of what we had;\n\nDraping for the Chapel ( see below pictures) - $350\nWicker Lounge set up for 8-10 people $135x 2 - $270\nLantern Structure - $125 (I provided my own lanterns as this was cheaper)\nString of 10 lanterns $75 x 3 - $225 ( my own lanterns)\nCandy Table with Candy for 30ppl - $ 330 \nLight trees for around the terrace $35 x4 $140\nGlass vases with surrounding candles and mirror base $15 x5 $75 \nDelivery and set up $150\n\nI provided a lot of my own things as it worked out cheaper. Plus I wanted to colour match things. If you need any help or advice you are welcome to email me emilykate.field@hotmail.co.uk\nI'd be happy to help. I loved planning my wedding so much. Savour every moment as it goes so quickly.\n\nHope that helped a bit\n\nEmily xx\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437680686,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":102922,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nWafflesmom (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" unless they've changed this recently, there are three palace approved vendors for decor: Gama, zuniga and LatinAsia\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437670267,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102923,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=findpost&p=1901029\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" unless they've changed this recently, there are three palace approved vendors for decor: Gama, zuniga and LatinAsia\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437670267,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102919,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"JessieL\" I am not able to confirm this, but I did stay at the Moon Palace Grand when I was there. Honestly, I actually would've preferred a different section of the resort (just personal preference) because MPG is off to the side and it's pretty remote and tucked away from the rest of the resort. All of the good restaurants and attractions are in the main area of the building which you would have to take a shuttle to constantly. My fiance and I spent more time taking shuttles to other parts of the resort, than we did lingering around the MPG area. \n \nIt's a very beautiful area of the resort, but my one complaint would've been that it really is so remote and you do feel so far away from all of the action and fun at the resort.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79285-moon-palace-grand-closed-for-remodeling\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTI4NTsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437669359,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79285},{"Id":102917,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Bride To Be - Tips And Ideas Please","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Bride To Be - Tips And Ideas Please\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" Moon Palace is MASSIVE and there are SOO many perfect spots there to have your wedding. I know It's probably a disappointment to have to move terraces, but I think once you see the other options in person you will be really happy with them. I've stayed at the resort myself and the grounds are lovely no matter what section you're in.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79396-moon-palace-bride-to-be-tips-and-ideas-please\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTM5NjsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437668485,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79396},{"Id":102918,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79396-moon-palace-bride-to-be-tips-and-ideas-please\/?view=findpost&p=1901024\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" Moon Palace is MASSIVE and there are SOO many perfect spots there to have your wedding. I know It's probably a disappointment to have to move terraces, but I think once you see the other options in person you will be really happy with them. I've stayed at the resort myself and the grounds are lovely no matter what section you're in.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437668485,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102907,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" is totally right. I went through Zuniga as a vendor and they had these arched bamboo poles that have two chinese lanterns hanging from them. I can't remember the exact price off the top of my head.. but it was a lot less and it required no poles to be installed. I basically have one beside each guest table (3 tables) and I have 4 of them to frame the \"dance floor\" area in the shape of a square. I rented a  hanging chandelier for above the head table. The chandeliers are quite a bit more than the bamboo poles which is why I am only renting one.\n \nLighting is definitely a necessity in most cases. I know that at Beach Palace, almost every single terrace they have available for the reception has no lighting. I felt super stressed about lighting when I first started planning, but now i'm happy I found a cheaper option. The string lights (for three strings + tensors) would've cost me $1000 USD if I did them. Lighting is now costing me half of that (including the chandelier). \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437667602,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102886,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nWafflesmom (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nHi @\"SUREKHA\" I'm so sorry to hear that they've had to change your reception venue on you. I know it can be quite disappointing, especially if you've already had a vision of what your day will look like.\n\nI've seen some photos of the Venado terrace on this forum and it was beautiful! Based on your post, did you say there's no structure to hang lights? If that's the case, there are lots of other options. @\"perianjay\" ran into this same problem and is now using the lanterns on bamboo fixtures. There's also hanging chandeliers if you prefer. Or you can always get the lighting options from a DJ if you choose to have one. Another idea may be to do the under table lights, and have a light up dance floor. You have plenty of options <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437665188,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102888,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=findpost&p=1901017\n\n----------------------------------\nHi @\"SUREKHA\" I'm so sorry to hear that they've had to change your reception venue on you. I know it can be quite disappointing, especially if you've already had a vision of what your day will look like.\n\nI've seen some photos of the Venado terrace on this forum and it was beautiful! Based on your post, did you say there's no structure to hang lights? If that's the case, there are lots of other options. @\"perianjay\" ran into this same problem and is now using the lanterns on bamboo fixtures. There's also hanging chandeliers if you prefer. Or you can always get the lighting options from a DJ if you choose to have one. Another idea may be to do the under table lights, and have a light up dance floor. You have plenty of options <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437665188,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102851,"Title":"liked a post you made in Moon Palace Bride To Be - T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nChris126 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMy wedding here is booked now!I had read so many good reviews and a few bad \ud83d\ude16 the good seem to weigh out over the bad.I think the hotel itself will be amazing and the wedding planners at the hotel seem to be really good at what they do.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79396-moon-palace-bride-to-be-tips-and-ideas-please\/?view=findpost&p=1900899\n","Sender":{"Id":284060,"Name":"Chris126","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437657189,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102845,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\ncolleentf09 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"MOON PALACE BRIDES\".\n\ncolleentf09 said:\n======================================================================\nI feel the same way, I know there's probably a lot more to do than I'm realizing right now. I'm working with Lizet right now, do you know when we switch to the coordinator that is actually at the resort? \nWe just choose the complimentary package. I'm trying to figure out easy centerpieces that won't be crazy expensive. I haven't gotten any quotes yet on decor but I think I've only been given the brochure for Zuniga. I wonder if the prices are similar to grupo gams? \n\nI didn't know there was going to be work done to the grand section. I only know about it from people posting on here. My coordinator or travel agent haven't said anything and we even visited the resort in May and no one told us.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10720&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437651680,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10720},{"Id":102837,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\ncolleentf09 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"MOON PALACE BRIDES\".\n\ncolleentf09 said:\n======================================================================\nPlanning is going alright, I've been slacking a little until recently! The biggest things are deciding on a menu and figuring out what to do for decor\/centerpieces. I'm still waiting on an email back from my coordinator from almost a week ago [emoji53] How's your planning going?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10720&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437640536,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10720},{"Id":102703,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Bride To Be - Tips And Ideas Please","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nWafflesmom (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Bride To Be - Tips And Ideas Please\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"colleentf09\" yes, it's on the Grand side. There's actually extra charges for having private events here since it's a rooftop terrace and servers have to go up a flight if stairs. I've heated great things about it though.\n\nI'm also at Tucan Terrace. A previous bride moved her reception to the Tucan gazebo when it rained but she didn't have a large number of guests. She said it was a beautiful setting\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79396-moon-palace-bride-to-be-tips-and-ideas-please\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTM5NjsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437612302,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79396},{"Id":100819,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome SUREKHA to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello SUREKHA,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destination Wedding Community & Forum (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/)<br \/>Resort Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/resorts-villas)<br \/>Wedding Vendor Reviews (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/wedding-vendors)<br \/>Destination Wedding Tips and Articles (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips)<br \/>Wedding Image Gallery (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/recent\/albums)<br \/>BDW Help Page (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=help)<br \/>BDW Forum Rules and Etiquette (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/8853\/forum-faqs-etiquette-rules)<br \/>How to Download Attachments (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/48545\/update-1-18-2010-downloading-attachments)<br \/><br \/>Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:<br \/><br \/>Moderators and Community Leaders<br \/>Tammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/206696-tammy-host\/). Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006<br \/>AlexisinJamaica (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/255437-alexisinjamaica\/) - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.<br \/><br \/>If you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:<br \/>BDW on Facebook (http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Twitter (http:\/\/twitter.com\/BDWForum)<br \/>BDW on Pinterest (http:\/\/pinterest.com\/bdwforum\/)<br \/><br \/>If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business, please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com (mailto:advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20Inquiry%20for%20BDW).<br \/><br \/>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read! (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010)<br \/><br \/>Please feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.<br \/><br \/>Team BDW\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=10600#msg19174\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436869767,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10600}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"22","TotalPages":1,