{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":2,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1170,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1604162,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":239725,"Name":"NowDestinations","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1333642710,"LastPoster":{"Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":57,"Preview":{"Id":1604162,"PostDate":1333642710,"PostContent":"\u00a0  \u00a0  I put together a quick read on the top 10 reasons why destination weddings are the modern...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sb@nowdestinations.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1304741219,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NowDestinations","Id":239725,"Name":"NowDestinations","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66778,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba4d55a758a1fa575e4d1ec9fb9255e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248); text-align: -webkit-auto; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;font color=\"#444444\" face=\"&#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;i&gt;I put together a quick read on the top 10 reasons why destination weddings are the modern trend...enjoy! :)&lt;\/i&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;1.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;IT FITS THE BUDGET&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/nowdestinationweddings.com\/\"&gt;Destination Weddings&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;can be far less expensive for couples than a traditional wedding at home. This all depends on the size and requirements of the groom and bride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;2.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;PLANNING IS EASIER&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; The stress of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/nowdestinations.com\/plan-your-wedding\"&gt;planning your wedding&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;falls to your Destination Wedding Specialist and your resort wedding co-ordinator. You envision it, and let everything else fall into place.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;3.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;QUALITY TIME&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; You get a chance to spend more quality time with the family and friends in a more intimate setting for a longer period of time \u00e2\u20ac\u201c not just a day as with a traditional wedding at home.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;4.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;THE LOCATION&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; Barefoot on a beautiful white-sand beach, surrounded by the lush tropical gardens or surrounded in a gazebo overlooking turquoise waters or even exchanging vows in an Italian Villa..these are just a few of the breath-taking setting choices in collection for destination weddings.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;5.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;EVERYTHING IS IN ONE PLACE&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; No time wasted travelling from the church, to a park or garden for pictures, then to the reception. From the walk down the aisle to the last dance, everything takes place at your resort.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;6.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;IT\u00e2\u20ac\u2122S A VACATION TOO&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; Not only do your family and friends get to witness and celebrate your vows, after the ceremony everyone gets to relax and enjoy a vacation too.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;7.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;SMALLER GUEST LIST&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; Due to monetary reasons or time constraints, attending a destination wedding may not be for everyone and those that attend are usually the ones that are most dear to you&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;8.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;NO FAMILY FEUDS&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; A destination wedding provides an equal playing field between the families and more importantly, no uncomfortable decisions for couples to make that may cause a sticky situation between families.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;9.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;THE GUYS LIKE IT TOO&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; Guys seem to get more excited about a destination wedding and even the groom becomes more involved in the planning process. Organizing smaller events such as golfing or sailing with his buddies, makes him happier than picking out table centerpieces and d\u00a9cor.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \"&gt;10.&lt;span style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; white-space: pre; \"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;AND THE HONEYMOON BEGINS&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/h3&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-family: &#039;Lucida Grande&#039;, &#039;Lucida Grand&#039;, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"&gt; If desired, you can begin your honeymoon immediately after the ceremony. No early morning planes to catch, no time wasted travelling and no additional costs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1604162,"PostDate":1333642710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <h3 style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: rgb(248, 248, 248); text-align: -webkit-auto; \"> \u00a0<\/h3> <h3 style=\"padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <font color=\"#444444\" face=\"'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 12px\"><strong><i>I put together a quick read on the top 10 reasons why destination weddings are the modern trend...enjoy! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/i><\/strong><\/span><\/font><\/h3> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">1.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>IT FITS THE BUDGET<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> <a href='http:\/\/nowdestinationweddings.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Destination Weddings<\/a>\u00a0can be far less expensive for couples than a traditional wedding at home. This all depends on the size and requirements of the groom and bride.\u00a0<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">2.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>PLANNING IS EASIER<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> The stress of\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/nowdestinations.com\/plan-your-wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>planning your wedding<\/a>\u00a0falls to your Destination Wedding Specialist and your resort wedding co-ordinator. You envision it, and let everything else fall into place.<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">3.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>QUALITY TIME<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> You get a chance to spend more quality time with the family and friends in a more intimate setting for a longer period of time \u00e2\u20ac\u201c not just a day as with a traditional wedding at home.<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">4.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>THE LOCATION<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> Barefoot on a beautiful white-sand beach, surrounded by the lush tropical gardens or surrounded in a gazebo overlooking turquoise waters or even exchanging vows in an Italian Villa..these are just a few of the breath-taking setting choices in collection for destination weddings.<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">5.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>EVERYTHING IS IN ONE PLACE<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> No time wasted travelling from the church, to a park or garden for pictures, then to the reception. From the walk down the aisle to the last dance, everything takes place at your resort.<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">6.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>IT\u00e2\u20ac\u2122S A VACATION TOO<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> Not only do your family and friends get to witness and celebrate your vows, after the ceremony everyone gets to relax and enjoy a vacation too.<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">7.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>SMALLER GUEST LIST<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> Due to monetary reasons or time constraints, attending a destination wedding may not be for everyone and those that attend are usually the ones that are most dear to you<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">8.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>NO FAMILY FEUDS\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> A destination wedding provides an equal playing field between the families and more importantly, no uncomfortable decisions for couples to make that may cause a sticky situation between families.<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">9.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>THE GUYS LIKE IT TOO<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> Guys seem to get more excited about a destination wedding and even the groom becomes more involved in the planning process. Organizing smaller events such as golfing or sailing with his buddies, makes him happier than picking out table centerpieces and d\u00a9cor.<\/p> <h3 style=\"color: rgb(66, 174, 255); font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 22px; padding-top: 10px; padding-right: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; \"> <strong style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-top-width: 0px; border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-image: initial; outline-width: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-color: initial; vertical-align: baseline; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-color: transparent; \">10.<span  style=\"margin-left: 0px;background-color: transparent\"> <\/span>AND THE HONEYMOON BEGINS<\/strong><\/h3> <p  style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family:'Lucida Grande', 'Lucida Grand', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); \"> If desired, you can begin your honeymoon immediately after the ceremony. No early morning planes to catch, no time wasted travelling and no additional costs.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sb@nowdestinations.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1304741219,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NowDestinations","Id":239725,"Name":"NowDestinations","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66778,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a0caab76586563dfe4b1d896777c917","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;10 reasons why couples choose destination weddings are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;The couples love to travel. This reason is common for most since they want to explore a different location and at the same time share their passion to their guests&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;The influence of family. Others who choose destination weddings are influenced by the decision of their family especially if they know that the suggestion being made by their relative would specially suit them.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;3.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;Not being able to find the perfect venue on their own hometown. When this becomes the case, couples start looking beyond the U.S. borders.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;4. P&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;roblems with the season. This is mostly true when the couple just do not want to have a winter theme for their December affair.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;5. The influence of family&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;6.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;The couples just fell in love with the place. For most cases, couples who choose destination wedding&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;just fell in love to a place they already know or just heard about.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;7. You can limit your guest list.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;8.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;You get to choose from thousands of breathtakingly beautiful locations.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;9. You get to spend less.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px;\"&gt;10. To enjoy a different atmosphere and culture&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896736,"PostDate":1432191586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>10 reasons why couples choose destination weddings are:\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1.\u00a0<span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">The couples love to travel. This reason is common for most since they want to explore a different location and at the same time share their passion to their guests<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">2.\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">\u00a0The influence of family. Others who choose destination weddings are influenced by the decision of their family especially if they know that the suggestion being made by their relative would specially suit them.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">3.<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">\u00a0Not being able to find the perfect venue on their own hometown. When this becomes the case, couples start looking beyond the U.S. borders.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">4. P<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">roblems with the season. This is mostly true when the couple just do not want to have a winter theme for their December affair.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">5. The influence of family\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">6.\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">The couples just fell in love with the place. For most cases, couples who choose destination wedding\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">just fell in love to a place they already know or just heard about.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">7. You can limit your guest list.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">8.\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">You get to choose from thousands of breathtakingly beautiful locations.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">9. You get to spend less.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;font-size:13.3333330154419px\">10. To enjoy a different atmosphere and culture<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katherineriverace@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425100717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282278.png?_r=1425103909","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":242,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RitvikSehgal","Id":282278,"Name":"RitvikSehgal","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"66778","Title":"10 Reasons Why Couples Choose Destination Weddings","LastPostDate":1432191586},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
