           <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies, I want to get married in Bali at the end of next year.. just wondering if you're using a wedding planner or if you're jut doing it through the resort\/place you're having the wedding?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"l.magick@live.com.au","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341725563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257592.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":95,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Amanda Bowater","Id":257592,"Name":"Amanda Bowater","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f3e3a0ca50f57c0c30e93c5badc7a65","RawContent":"Hi ladies, I want toget married in Bali at the end of next year. Just wondering if you&#039;re using a wedding planner or just doing it yourselves through the resort you&#039;re getting married at?","Attachments":[],"Id":1639246,"PostDate":1341727223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies, I want toget married in Bali at the end of next year. Just wondering if you're using a wedding planner or just doing it yourselves through the resort you're getting married at?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"l.magick@live.com.au","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341725563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257592.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":95,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Amanda Bowater","Id":257592,"Name":"Amanda Bowater","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"394bb517a3c37cf1038c6af19e6bf510","RawContent":"Hello ladies we&#039;re getting married in the Pantai Lima villas (north of Seminyak) next April.... Can&#039;t wait! We&#039;re using Erick of I Do weddings as he has done a few weddings there &amp; he seems pretty switched on. Who are you using for catering?","Attachments":[],"Id":1639368,"PostDate":1341783064,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies we're getting married in the Pantai Lima villas (north of Seminyak) next April.... Can't wait! We're using Erick of I Do weddings as he has done a few weddings there & he seems pretty switched on. Who are you using for catering?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lulu_la_belle@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1336405663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"balibride","Id":255039,"Name":"balibride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55961caafc18adfd2fe7fb0ef20f3295","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi we are using Beyond Events they are fabulous. Have a great website.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; They use Grocer and Grind as caterer.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have heard Bali Catering Company is the best by far - not just better food but their equipment such as bar etc are better quality.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also spoke to Global Weddings they were great but do charge about $3000 to organise the wedding but if you have the budget would be well worth it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Beyond Events make their money through the catering so dont charge you a fee as such. Rohan is amazing gets back to all my emails within 24 hours.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy to answer any other questions you have. I am heading over there next Friday to meet with people ie videographer.\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1639800,"PostDate":1341885149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi we are using Beyond Events they are fabulous. Have a great website.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> They use Grocer and Grind as caterer.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have heard Bali Catering Company is the best by far - not just better food but their equipment such as bar etc are better quality.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also spoke to Global Weddings they were great but do charge about $3000 to organise the wedding but if you have the budget would be well worth it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Beyond Events make their money through the catering so dont charge you a fee as such. Rohan is amazing gets back to all my emails within 24 hours.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy to answer any other questions you have. I am heading over there next Friday to meet with people ie videographer.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"felmingham@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1330754824,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252219.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":116,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"felmingham","Id":252219,"Name":"felmingham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4e4c4b21f104079651c1c66658b0d64","RawContent":"Exciting!, how did your planning trip go?","Attachments":[],"Id":1650806,"PostDate":1344540111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Exciting!, how did your planning trip go?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lulu_la_belle@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1336405663,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255039.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"balibride","Id":255039,"Name":"balibride","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"67396","Title":"Bali Weddings","LastPostDate":1408147468},"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
