> User ParisR (284124)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"853df45e305c8db940b8a15c92fc5a28","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Trip went well - actually going over in 2 weeks again. This time with partner to finalise some other things.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Slowly coming together. Invites getting designed as we speak. Will be good to send them out so we can start getting an idea of numbers.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1650948,"PostDate":1344562586,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Trip went well - actually going over in 2 weeks again. This time with partner to finalise some other things.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Slowly coming together. Invites getting designed as we speak. Will be good to send them out so we can start getting an idea of numbers.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"felmingham@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1330754824,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252219.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":116,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"felmingham","Id":252219,"Name":"felmingham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cccdd4cda07f24d4cffab002ee1ea542","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi I see that you were getting married in Vila Infinity and you used Beyond Events. We are looking at both of these at the moment for our wedding in September 2013. Would be really great to hear about your experiences with both and if you have had the wedding there yet?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1657384,"PostDate":1346153405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi I see that you were getting married in Vila Infinity and you used Beyond Events. We are looking at both of these at the moment for our wedding in September 2013. Would be really great to hear about your experiences with both and if you have had the wedding there yet?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katroundtheworld@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346153338,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259700.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saundersk81","Id":259700,"Name":"saundersk81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcb661de7e1d599332feba1078b14ba7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Not sure if my reply came through so sending again!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are looking at Villa Infinity and Beyond Events but can&#039;t find many reviews online. Would be good to hear about your experiences? When is your wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1657387,"PostDate":1346153896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Not sure if my reply came through so sending again!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are looking at Villa Infinity and Beyond Events but can't find many reviews online. Would be good to hear about your experiences? When is your wedding?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katroundtheworld@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1346153338,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259700.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"saundersk81","Id":259700,"Name":"saundersk81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88f8fa5648ae406687a3250083e88e3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are also looking at having a &#039;recovery session&#039; the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).\n Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1707614,"PostDate":1358510985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.<\/p> <p> We are also looking at having a 'recovery session' the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).<br \/> Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S<\/p> <p> Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"staciewedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358510133,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264642.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stacielea","Id":264642,"Name":"Stacielea","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98f9b9748e8054e32e12a2d2b12be669","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are also looking at having a &#039;recovery session&#039; the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).\n Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1707615,"PostDate":1358511054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.<\/p> <p> We are also looking at having a 'recovery session' the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).<br \/> Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S<\/p> <p> Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"staciewedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358510133,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264642.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stacielea","Id":264642,"Name":"Stacielea","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd65dfa61b52c84fff8e3545a45d5d4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are also looking at having a &#039;recovery session&#039; the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).\n Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1707616,"PostDate":1358511078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.<\/p> <p> We are also looking at having a 'recovery session' the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).<br \/> Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S<\/p> <p> Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"staciewedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358510133,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264642.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stacielea","Id":264642,"Name":"Stacielea","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c8ce42daf93b499f17b59ce14de23ec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sorry if this comes through twice....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are also looking at having a &#039;recovery session&#039; the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).\n Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1707617,"PostDate":1358511331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sorry if this comes through twice....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are getting married in Bali this year (June). We are just about to start the formal planning. We too have used Beyond Events and are getting married in Villa Infinity (very lucky to get in as it books out a fair while in advance). Beyond Events have been great to deal with, really prompt with email correspondence and we met up with Rohan at Grocer and Grind on 2 trips we made in Bali. We are going for the BBQ buffet menu which looks amazing. Unfortunately we wont make it back before the wedding to meet the suppliers, photographer etc.<\/p> <p> We are also looking at having a 'recovery session' the next day at Cocoon beach club in Legian (putting a bit of money on the bar and some nibbly food the evening after the wedding).<br \/> Would be very interested on hearing anyones suggestions for Hens\/Bucks shows in Bali. Dont want it to be too expensive as guests are travelling to get to the wedding but they would need to be able to accommodate about 30-40 pax on each........ :S<\/p> <p> Look forward to hearing other peoples stories and experiences.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"staciewedding@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358510133,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264642.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Stacielea","Id":264642,"Name":"Stacielea","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"101.127.224.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b467d725e1aacb85b75f8b70c72dea83","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey!\n\n\nI am planning to have my wedding in Bali next year, but have yet to decide on a venue. I came across these villas on a website called Wedding-bali.com -&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/venue\/villa-stella&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/venue\/villa-stella&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/venue\/villa-sungai-tinggi&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/venue\/villa-sungai-tinggi&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nThe photos of the villas are awesome! There&#039;s quite a lot on information on the website as well.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nHas anyone visited or gotten married at either of these villas before? I&#039;d love to hear from you if you did!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858054,"PostDate":1404381722,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey!<br><br>\nI am planning to have my wedding in Bali next year, but have yet to decide on a venue. I came across these villas on a website called Wedding-bali.com -<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/venue\/villa-stella' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.wedding-b...ue\/villa-stella<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/venue\/villa-sungai-tinggi' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.wedding-b...a-sungai-tinggi<\/a><br><br>\nThe photos of the villas are awesome! There's quite a lot on information on the website as well.\u00a0<br><br>\nHas anyone visited or gotten married at either of these villas before? I'd love to hear from you if you did!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandy78987@gmail.com","IpAddress":"101.127.224.29","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404380463,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mandy78987","Id":278813,"Name":"Mandy78987","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"124.190.86.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67396,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e973f508337a839cf810d9fe7b90e80c","RawContent":"All of these places look amazing :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1866917,"PostDate":1408147468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                All of these places look amazing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexandraksymons@bigpond.com","IpAddress":"124.190.86.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408099091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"xxalex18","Id":279443,"Name":"xxalex18","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
