can begin creating a package that&#039;s customized just for you!  PINNACLE BRIDE is South Florida&#039;s Premier Group of Cinematographers and Photographers excelling in professionalism, creativity, and innovation. Cherish your moments for a lifetime with imagery that is captured with a detailed eye. The Pinnacle Bride Creative Network is trendsetting and passionate; working to fulfill the needs of all clients in a personal and professional manner. Pinnacle Bride&#039;s mission is to ensure that your paramount emotions are captured. Choosing Pinnacle Bride isn&#039;t a decision; it&#039;s an investment that will last a lifetime.  We travel to the islands frequently as we love our Destination Brides! OUR PRICING is competitive for the type of work that we do and we are always ready and willing to work to meet the standards of our couples! Call us so we can discuss our packages! And always know that you can let us know your budget and we can try to formulate a Customized Package that suits you!  OUR CONTACT person is Arturo Lorde, owner of Pinnacle Bride. He can be reached at 954-410-4434 and would love to get to know you, provide you with further information, lock in your wedding date, and start working on creating your wedding experience! OUR WORK SAMPLES http:\/\/vimeo.com\/22107624 http:\/\/vimeo.com\/23689477 http:\/\/vimeo.com\/39168180 We look forward to hearing from you! And we wish you the best on your Big Day! Truly Yours, PINNACLE BRIDE","Attachments":[],"Id":1616608,"PostDate":1336394221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We at Pinnacle Bride heard you were looking for a wedding videographer!\u00a0And now we're ready to hear your budget so that we can begin creating a package that's customized just for you!\u00a0 PINNACLE BRIDE\u00a0is South Florida's Premier Group of Cinematographers and Photographers excelling in professionalism, creativity, and innovation. Cherish your moments for a lifetime with imagery that is captured with a detailed eye. The Pinnacle Bride Creative Network is trendsetting and passionate; working to fulfill the needs of all clients in a personal and professional manner. Pinnacle Bride's mission is to ensure that your paramount emotions are captured. Choosing Pinnacle Bride isn't a decision; it's an investment that will last a lifetime.\u00a0 We travel to the islands frequently as we love our Destination Brides! OUR PRICING\u00a0is competitive for the type of work that we do and we are always ready and willing to work to meet the standards of our couples! Call us so we can discuss our\u00a0packages! And\u00a0always know that you can let us know your budget and we can try to formulate a Customized Package that suits you!\u00a0 OUR CONTACT\u00a0person is Arturo Lorde, owner of Pinnacle Bride. He can be reached at\u00a0954-410-4434\u00a0and would love to get to know you, provide you with further information, lock in your wedding date, and start working on creating your wedding experience! OUR WORK SAMPLES <iframe src=\"http:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/22107624\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe> <iframe src=\"http:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/23689477\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe> <iframe src=\"http:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/39168180\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe> We look forward to hearing from you! And we wish you the best on your Big Day! Truly Yours, PINNACLE BRIDE\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kymmie0923@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"98.170.197.40","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1336393335,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255030.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kymmie0923","Id":255030,"Name":"Kymmie0923","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"67346","Title":"The Go To Videographer & Cinamatographer for Destination Weddings!","LastPostDate":1336394221},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
